cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Pulse_Research: an orthogonal-oracle Gaussian-process surrogate for +Gz × hypoxia G-LOC tolerance"
abstract: >-
  A no-fitted-parameter multi-fidelity surrogate composing the CAMI G-Effects
  Model (CGEM) and the Pulse Physiology Engine through a Hüfner arterial-oxygen
  -content ratio, with ARD Matérn-5/2 Gaussian-process emulators and split-
  conformal coverage, for rapid-onset +Gz-induced loss of consciousness under
  FiO₂-equivalent hypoxia.
type: software
